	.asciz	"\nload_next(\300\013) returned \301 \000\200`$, neither TAIL nor a valid index (< \301 \000\200`=): pop_index's truncating pack would silently truncate it to \300"
	.size	.Lanon.a8bfb3e8b9fd6e33beee9d2edb5f05da.11, 135

	.type	.Lanon.a8bfb3e8b9fd6e33beee9d2edb5f05da.12,@object
