.Lanon.23259037a3a70673b05912dcb3a98f08.10:
	.ascii	"the EMPTY SENTINEL, leaking the whole remaining chain"
	.size	.Lanon.23259037a3a70673b05912dcb3a98f08.10, 53

	.type	.Lanon.23259037a3a70673b05912dcb3a98f08.11,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.23259037a3a70673b05912dcb3a98f08.11,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.23259037a3a70673b05912dcb3a98f08.11:
	.asciz	"\nload_next(\300\013) returned \301 \000\200`$, neither TAIL nor a valid index (< \301 \000\200`=): pop_index's truncating pack would silently truncate it to \300"
	.size	.Lanon.23259037a3a70673b05912dcb3a98f08.11, 135

	.type	.Lanon.23259037a3a70673b05912dcb3a98f08.12,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.23259037a3a70673b05912dcb3a98f08.12,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.23259037a3a70673b05912dcb3a98f08.12:
	.asciz	"\nload_next(\300\013) returned \301 \000\200`\200\272\000, the index's own link points back to itself \342\200\224 a self-loop, corrupting the free-list into a cycle: pop_index's truncating pack would silently re-issue this same index to a second owner"
	.size	.Lanon.23259037a3a70673b05912dcb3a98f08.12, 219

	.type	.Lanon.23259037a3a70673b05912dcb3a98f08.13,@object
